  "notes": "Worker names: M##_H## - milestone name (e.g. M01_H00 - ui improvement). M = milestone, H = handover within that milestone. New milestone -> M+1, H00. Worker replaced mid-milestone -> same M, H+1. Fix rounds keep the same worker and name. The same ID goes on the chat title, handoff doc, commits and progress log. Rules live in AGENTS.md; milestone names in milestones.md. Orchestrator chats rotate too: 00 - Orchestrator O01, O02… (O = orchestrator handover). Same rule as workers: compact once at a safe point, hand off the second time; you start the fresh orchestrator chat. Orchestrator handover: the old and new orchestrator overlap briefly and run a 3-point handover check. progress.md starts with OWNER: 00 - Orchestrator O##; only the owner sends tasks, starts workers or accepts results.",
